{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"埃及","country_iso":"EGY","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:50:21.082497","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"EGY-HB-0005","ldc":"No","location":"吉萨省","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"埃及吉萨省30MW垃圾发电项目","project_name_en":"Egypt Giza 30MW Waste-to-Energy Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"能建国际集团","content":"当地时间6月1日，中国能建国际集团与江苏院共同推动的埃及首个垃圾发电项目——阿布拉瓦须垃圾发电项目成功中标，实现了中国能建在埃及市场新突破。业主Renergy公司首席执行官Robert，国际集团副总裁、西北非区域总部执行总经理朱洪刚参加授标仪式。\n授标仪式合影\n项目位于埃及吉萨省，总装机容量30MW，垃圾处理量为1200吨/天，工程内容包括整个电厂的设计、采购、施工和调试，业主为埃及军工生产部、Green Tech Egypt LLC、巴林OAK Group Holdings联合成立的公私合营企业Renergy Group Partners LLC（简称“Renergy”）。该项目是埃及为推动市政固体废物再利用，缓解城市环境污染而实施的战略性项目，建成后将大幅减少废物堆积，改善居民生活环境，实现经济效益和社会效益的双向提升，引领未来埃及垃圾发电领域绿色低碳发展。\n项目效果图\n授标仪式上，Robert表示，埃及高度重视可再生能源发展，正大力推动绿色能源转型。该项目作为埃及首个垃圾发电项目，在环境保护、可再生能源投资等领域意义重大。希望中国能建整合优势资源，发挥专业技术能力，协助Renergy推动项目落地，双方携手将该项目打造成埃及可持续发展新标杆。\n垃圾发电将废弃物转化为能源，是推动可持续发展的重要路径之一。该项目中标不仅是中国能建在埃及市场取得的重要突破，更是与全球战略合作伙伴深入推动高质量共建“一带一路”、落实中非“十大伙伴行动”的生动实践。中国能建将积极践行“三引领一合作”理念，同Renergy公司一道，持续深耕埃及市场，打造更多绿色转型示范项目，为埃及绿色低碳发展贡献力量。","content_sha256":"6cb753d6ec1deaf1bff80664f9f65f887b5d57ec313e014dda7af45b16959038","id":3376,"publish_date":"2025-06-04 09:08:35","title":"中国能建中标埃及首个垃圾发电项目","title_sha256":"0f1e88cbfe6a9c57bb475a097f96ba1870e51e211d131818bd163b0c5901c64c","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/83524.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"EGY-HB-0005","capacity_details":"30MW","capacity_mw":30.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"30","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:50:21.082565","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"EGY-HB-0005-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"http://www.gjjt.ceec.net.cn/art/2025/6/4/art_61148_3166.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Renergy Group Partners LLC","project_developer_en":"Renergy Group Partners LLC","project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"中国能建中标埃及吉萨省的阿布拉瓦须垃圾发电项目，该项目总装机容量30MW，是埃及首个垃圾发电项目，目前处于中标阶段。","publish_date":"2025-06-04 09:08:35","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/83524.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"EGY-HB-0005","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category"]}
